\subsection{Dataset}

The dataset is a collection of news articles from the Guardian newspaper. The dataset is split into two parts: the training set and the test set. The training set contains 1,000 articles, and the test set contains 100 articles. Each article is represented as a sequence of words, and the task is to generate a summary of the article. The dataset is available for download at \url{https://github.com/jasonwei20/summarization-dataset}.

