\subsection{Dataset}

The dataset is composed of a set of $N$ pairs of sentences, where each pair is a question and a response. The dataset is split into a training set, a validation set and a test set. The training set is composed of $N_{train}$ pairs of sentences, the validation set is composed of $N_{val}$ pairs of sentences and the test set is composed of $N_{test}$ pairs of sentences.

